== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Troll Warrior, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: Go find Ranjor. . .give note Ranjor. . .become great warrior.

Upon handing the note to [[Ranjor]]:

: [[Ranjor]] says, 'Arhh.. Ranjor mighty warrior.. Ranjor teach you warrior.. you fight for Ranjor now.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Da Bashers]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Broken Skull Clan]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Mud Covered Tunic*]]. Good luck, warrior!

